00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.960
Nothing ever happens, he said.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:04.100
It was still dark, and the farmer got ready to leave for the field.

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:06.400
His son Pablo was still asleep.

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:11.060
Perhaps today, said his wife, something will happen.

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:15.020
No, said the farmer, nothing will.

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:22.150
