00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.970
There is no school today, Papa, said Pablo.

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:39.140
I have come to help you plow. Pablo helped the farmer plow the field. The ox pooled and the plow

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:48.300
